The [[Box of Riches]] is a rare item available in the shop for all characters. 

The [[Box of Riches]] is required to be able to get [[gemstone]]s. When entering the shop, if it is in your inventory, it will give the player one common rarity [[gemstone]] and put it next to the box in their inventory if it can, otherwise it gets thrown into the storage area.

While the player has at least one Box of Riches in their inventory they will be able to find [[gemstone]]s of any rarity in the shop.

The "shop entered" effect does not activate if the item is in storage.

The [[Box of Riches]] can be crafted into a few eclectic items. Crafting a [[Box of Riches]] with a [[Maneki-neko]] (Maneki-neko not consumed), the Box "opens up" into the [[Box of Prosperity]], which gives four backpack slots, and still enables the player to generate [[Gemstones]] by putting at least two Godly or Unique items inside, although they will lose the ability to buy gemstones in the shop. [[Box of Riches]] + [[Glowing Crown]] gives the [[King Crown]], which makes for a great place to socket the player's rarer gemstones, increasing their effects by 50%. Finally, the [[Adventurer]] can combine the [[Box of Riches]] and a [[Piggybank]] with [[Twine]] to create the [[Piggy of Riches]], which is a straight [[Box of Riches]] upgrade. It gives two chipped gemstones each round instead of one, and additionally gives maximum health for each socketed gemstone.

In general, the [[Box of Riches]] is a great choice whenever there are sockets to fill.
